{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-cemetery-group","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:cemetery-group","kind":"definition","title":"Cemetery group (subcategory annihilated by $\\tau$)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-observation","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hecke-normal-form"],"cites":["references/khovanovlauda2009","references/brundankleshchev2009"],"tags":["cemetery-group","subcategory","decoupling","klr","observation-frame"],"defines":["cemetery-group"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup","text":"cemetery-group.md","leanSource":"cemetery-group.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:cemetery-group\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(R, q)</code> be the Iwahori–Hecke algebra and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{K}_n</code> denote the category of finitely generated graded projective modules over the Khovanov–Lauda–Rouquier algebra whose cyclotomic quotient is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(R, q)</code>. The fibre functor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau \\colon \\mathcal{K}_n \\to \\mathrm{Vect}</code> acts as decategorification by graded Euler characteristic. For a graded module <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">M = \\bigoplus_{d \\in \\mathbb{Z}} M_d</code>,</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\tau(M) \\;:=\\; \\sum_{d \\in \\mathbb{Z}} (-1)^d \\dim_R M_d \\;\\in\\; R.</code></pre>\n<p><em>The <dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-cemetery-group\">cemetery group</dfn> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_n(R, q)</code> is the localising Serre subcategory</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{Z}_n \\;:=\\; \\ker \\tau\n  \\;=\\; \\{\\, M \\in \\mathcal{K}_n : \\tau(M) = 0 \\,\\}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.6.6","page":"b/def-cemetery-group","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroup","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
